' A room's grids by keys (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3 start 30`,
' Paradise Camp's tent). Right lights the floor's first item; Space clicks it,
' which takes it into the pack; Left crosses into the pack at its nearest
' edge (`FocusEdge`) and Left again moves along it; F right-clicks the lit
' slot (`ActivateFocusedItem`); Escape leaves the room.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
press right              ' the floor's first item
press space              ' taken
wait 5
press left               ' into the pack
press left
press f                  ' right-clicked
wait 5
press escape             ' out
wait 5
quit
